      "message": "refactor(sim): a field carried between setups is the same field seen through the turn\n\n#637 step A (M7.3): CarriedField views an SdfField through a setup\nchange's LatticeTurn - distance(p) = field.distance(T^-1 p), exact (a\nsigned distance is invariant under rigid motion), nothing re-sampled:\nthe field analogue of carry's \"re-index, never re-sample\". LatticeTurn\ngains unapply (the exact inverse) and then (composition). Not yet used\nby carry::Body (steps B-D).\n\nPinned by field_carry (3): unapply inverts apply and then composes for\nall eight turns; a cut field reads bit-identical through every turn;\ncarrying twice equals carrying through the composed turn.\n\nRefs #637\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
